# Project documentation

This directory contains project-wide information. Topic-local proofs, evidence,
implementation details, and thesis prose remain with their topic.

[Current state](../memories/todos.md) owns the task/status summary.
[The candidate](../thesis/candidate/README.md) owns the working thesis and
[pending integration](../thesis/candidate/integration.md).

| Entry | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| [Project facts](project-facts.md) | Attributed decisions and context; check dates and sources when applying them |
| [Source recovery](source-recovery/README.md) | Dependency hashes and frozen-PDF rebuild evidence |
| [Review evidence](review-evidence/README.md) | Preserved attributed reviews and human feedback |
| [Capacity calculation map](capacity-calculation-map.md) | Calculation contracts and implementation routes |
| [Algorithm testing](algorithm-testing.md) | Focused checks, confidence layers, and command side effects |
| [Reproduction](reproducibility.md) | Thesis code/data routes and unresolved release-build alignment |
| [Artifacts](artifacts.md) | R2 snapshot materialization and publication |
| [Development environments](development-environments.md) | Environment ownership, setup boundaries, and dated checks |

Dated assessments, process audits, session briefs, and
[migration review](migration-review.md) are historical evidence or proposals.
They do not establish current assignments or validate the working candidate.

## Historical agent guidance

Former project skills and steering were removed from the working tree because
they were already quarantined, had no identified active consumer, and added
obsolete guidance to searches. Their complete tracked contents are available
at commit `892fc9ab3b3c242cd961cfa469f6d81cef0d626d` under
`.agents/legacy-skills/` and `.codex/legacy-steering/`.

```bash
git ls-tree -r --name-only 892fc9ab -- .agents/legacy-skills .codex/legacy-steering
git show 892fc9ab:.agents/legacy-skills/README.md
```

Use `git show <commit>:<path>` to read an individual historical file. These
files are fallible recovery material, not current instructions.

The former `.worktrees/migration-scratch` proposals are preserved separately on
branch `archive/migration-scratch-2026-09-05`, commit `c14e33c8`. Useful repairs
were transferred individually; the archive's AGENTS.md and model policies were
not adopted. Its old PDF/log and remaining generated files are preserved at
`/home/joern/.local/share/msc-math-recovery/migration-scratch-2026-09-05.qeW9jF/`.
